B705\">3rd & 10: dime, 6 DBs to cover receivers</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"208\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">rushers sprint straight</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"221\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">at the QB, ignoring the run</text></svg></div>\n<p class=\"note\">Next: special teams, the third unit nobody watches until it decides a game.</p>",
